  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 540
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这修炼的功法以天阶为首，地阶次之，人阶则最为普通。相对的，越强大的功法也越难领悟，想要突破到高层更是需要上百年的苦修努力。所以从人阶功法开始打好基础，非常重要。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114639967039082256}
  AvatarIntID: 413
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
